### 1. Criar usuário
POST http://localhost:8080/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Usuario Teste",
  "phone": "84999990000"
}

### 2. Buscar usuário
GET http://localhost:8080/users/1

### 3. Criar conta corrente
POST http://localhost:8080/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "name": "Conta principal",
  "type": "CHECKING",
  "initialBalance": 1500.00
}

### 4. Criar cartão de crédito
POST http://localhost:8080/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "name": "Cartão principal",
  "type": "CREDIT_CARD",
  "creditLimit": 3000.00,
  "closingDay": 10,
  "dueDay": 17
}

### 5. Listar contas do usuário
GET http://localhost:8080/accounts?userId=1

### Disparar relatório mensal (teste)
POST http://localhost:8080/outbox/monthly-reports/run